{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-634694474978624018 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=634694474877895186&sectionId=634694474978624018)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpG-u0Nqvd_text","label":"ggpG-u0Nqvd_text","default":"Make a Hobby Part of the Conversation"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEpU9i2_s9_text","label":"ggEpU9i2_s9_text","default":"<p>Personalized gifts do not have to revolve around people either. A person's favorite hobby can make an excellent starting point.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone who loves cars might choose a photograph of a vehicle they have spent years working on. A motorcycle enthusiast might choose a picture from a memorable ride. Someone who loves traveling could recreate a favorite destination. A sports fan might choose a photograph connected to an unforgettable game or personal achievement.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The important part is that the subject gives the recipient something they are already excited to talk about. When a gift reflects something they genuinely care about, you do not have to force the conversation. It happens naturally.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For detailed subjects such as cars and motorcycles, a larger Memobrick can also help preserve recognizable features. Sizes such as 30x20 or 40x30 give the image more room, which can be especially useful when the photograph contains several important details.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHlOCE0sSP_text","label":"ggHlOCE0sSP_text","default":"When the Gift Becomes Part of the Room"},{"type":"html","id":"ggC2dUafp4Y_text","label":"ggC2dUafp4Y_text","default":"<p>A conversation does not have to happen when the gift is opened.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A good personalized piece can continue creating conversations every time someone sees it.</p><p>Imagine a guest noticing a colorful mosaic on the wall and asking about it. You explain what the photograph is, who is in it, and why you chose that particular moment. The object becomes an opening for a story that might never have come up otherwise.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is one reason choosing where to display a Memobrick can be part of the experience. Rather than hiding it among dozens of decorations, consider placing it somewhere people naturally spend time. A living room, hallway, office, bedroom, or hobby space can all give the piece an opportunity to be noticed.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1UxDreSQX_text","label":"gg1UxDreSQX_text","default":"<p>Personalized gifts are often associated with birthdays, Christmas, anniversaries, and other major occasions, but waiting for an event is not necessary.</p><p>A random Tuesday can be enough.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You might come across an old photograph and realize that someone you know would love seeing it again. You might find a picture from a trip that your friends still talk about. You might want to surprise someone with a reminder of a moment they had completely forgotten.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those unexpected gifts can sometimes create the strongest reactions because there are no expectations surrounding them. The recipient is not waiting for a present. They simply receive something that clearly had thought behind it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqjJoLp0b9_text","label":"ggqjJoLp0b9_text","default":"Choosing the Photograph Is Half the Fun"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzAH4bpPN6_text","label":"ggzAH4bpPN6_text","default":"<p>When creating a Memobrick as a gift, the photograph should not be chosen only because it looks good on a screen. Think about the reaction you want to create.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Do you want them to laugh? Choose the ridiculous photograph.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Do you want them to feel nostalgic? Find an older image they have not seen in years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Do you want them to talk about an adventure? Pick a photograph from the trip everyone still remembers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Do you want them to show it to everyone who visits? Choose something visually interesting that represents a passion or important part of their life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A photograph with a story gives the finished piece something that cannot be added through decoration alone.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_5OfAfk5c_text","label":"gg_5OfAfk5c_text","default":"The Experience Can Continue After the Gift Is Given"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7FtWmPyiN_text","label":"gg7FtWmPyiN_text","default":"<p>There is another reason a Memobrick can make an interesting present: the recipient gets to participate in creating the finished image.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The photograph is familiar, but the mosaic slowly reveals it in a completely different form. That process gives the recipient something to discover and gives the people around them another reason to get involved.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone might recognize the subject before the picture is finished. Someone else might notice a detail first. Another person might want to help with the next section.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The result is not just a finished decoration. The process of making it becomes another story connected to the original photograph.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo7ecceYKP_text","label":"ggo7ecceYKP_text","default":"Made by People Who Care About the Result"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsFPsCI1EA_text","label":"ggsFPsCI1EA_text","default":"<p>Personalization also means paying attention to the details behind the final product. At Memobrick, technology can help with the creative process, but the work does not simply stop there. We review the result, correct mistakes, and make adjustments when necessary so the finished mosaic represents the photograph as well as possible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That human involvement matters because every image is different. A photograph is not just a collection of colors and shapes when it belongs to a customer. It represents a person, a place, a hobby, a relationship, or a moment that they decided was worth turning into something permanent.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Technology helps us create it. People make sure we get it right.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqgOfLrT5l_text","label":"ggqgOfLrT5l_text","default":"<p>The best gifts do not always need to be the biggest or most expensive.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sometimes, they are simply the gifts that give people a reason to stop, smile, remember, and start talking.</p><p>A photograph already has a story behind it. Turning that photograph into a Memobrick gives people another way to experience that story, whether they are building it together, giving it as a surprise, or displaying it at home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because long after the gift has been opened, the conversations can continue.</p><p><strong>And sometimes, the best part of giving a gift is hearing the story it brings back.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSIFSmb5qj_text","label":"ggSIFSmb5qj_text","default":"Reviews from Happy Customers"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYtRXjDI8D_text","label":"ggYtRXjDI8D_text","default":"<p>So easy to understand and a nice relaxing project for my free time. Can't wait to do another one!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKXSFfWFbl_text","label":"ggKXSFfWFbl_text","default":"<p>-Aaryn C.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaCii03Ne4_childItem_0","label":"ggaCii03Ne4_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkn9YigrVF_text","label":"ggkn9YigrVF_text","default":"<p>\"I love these memo bricks! I ordered a smaller size, but when they emailed the mockup they showed me the difference of what it would look like compared to the bigger size. I was offered to upgrade\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggymABV5hia_text","label":"ggymABV5hia_text","default":"<p>-Kelsey M.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggN3UdyYrm4_childItem_0","label":"ggN3UdyYrm4_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0V4YtCsoB_text","label":"gg0V4YtCsoB_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;\"I split the photo in half so I could get 2 of the 60x20 so I could fill my wall more and its turned out AMAZING!\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5kkV4D4v9_text","label":"gg5kkV4D4v9_text","default":"<p>-Candice L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGMFheTViq_childItem_0","label":"ggGMFheTViq_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnO3VYmVUW_text","label":"ggnO3VYmVUW_text","default":"<p>\"Excellent customer service! The design team did an excellent job and we are so pleased to have a precious family picture transformed into such a cool art form.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg20jQGtbrE_text","label":"gg20jQGtbrE_text","default":"<p>-Aaron M.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVF_j4u8Y__childItem_0","label":"ggVF_j4u8Y__childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
  }
